1
00:00:02,798 --> 00:00:06,500
回憶迷惘殺戮多 | Huê-ik bê-bóng sat-lo̍k to | Memories are bewildered with endless slaughter

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,500
往事情仇待如何 | Óng-sū tsîng-siû thāi jû-hô | How should past love and vengeance be resolved?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
絹寫黑詩無限恨 | Kuàn siá hik-si bô-hān hūn | Silk scrolls inscribed with dark verse hold infinite sorrow

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,500
夙興夜寐枉徒勞 | Siok-hing iā-bī óng thôo-lô | Rising early and sleeping late in vain

5
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:43,000
烽火瀰漫宿將新敵荒土 | Hong-hué bí-bān siok-tsiòng sin-ti̍k hong-thóo | Beacon fires spread across the wasteland of veteran generals and new foes

6
00:00:42,798 --> 00:00:46,000
干戈動 | Kan-ko tōng | Weapons clash

7
00:00:45,399 --> 00:00:49,000
黃沙滾滾望眼染紅 | N̂g-sua kún-kún bōng-gán jiám hông | Billowing yellow sand stains gazing eyes blood red

8
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,399
恨情仇 | Hūn tsîng siû | Resentment, love, and vengeance

9
00:00:50,399 --> 00:00:55,299
痛離別 舊人今如何 | Thòng lî-pia̍t kū-jîn kim jû-hô | Bitter parting; how fare the companions of old today?

10
00:00:55,460 --> 00:01:00,460
夙興啊夜寐枉徒勞 | Siok-hing--ah iā-bī óng thôo-lô | Toil from dawn till dusk in utter vanity

11
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:05,840
塵煙無盡時 雁序紛飛 | Tîn-ian bô-tsīn sî gān-sū hun-hui | Dust and smoke without end; wild geese scatter in flight

12
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:11,390
英雄斷袍為征途 | Ing-hiông tuàn-phôo uī tsing-tôo | Heroes sever their robes to embark upon the journey of war

13
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:18,200
戰鼓雷鳴旌旗又揚起 | Tsiàn-kóo luî-bîng tsinn-kî iū iông-khí | War drums thunder as battle standards rise once more

14
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,599
戴盔甲行萬里 | Tè khue-kah hîng bān-lí | Donning armor to march ten thousand miles

15
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,599
爭不爭不容自己 | Tsenn put tsenn put jiông tsū-kí | Whether to fight or not is beyond one's choice

16
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,700
昔日兄弟志友既陌路人 | Sik-ji̍t hiann-tī tsì-iú kì bi̍k-lōo-jîn | Brothers and comrades of yesterday are now strangers

17
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:31,000
生與死亦無所謂 | Senn ú sí ia̍h bô-sóo-uī | Life or death matters no longer

18
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,400
戰鼓雷鳴金革聲四起 | Tsiàn-kóo luî-bîng kim-kik siann sù-khí | War drums thunder as weapons clash from all sides

19
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:32,099
掩罪容家何歸 | Iám tsuē-jiông ka hô kui | Concealing guilt on weary faces; where is home?

20
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:35,370
前奔不禁回馳 | Tsiân-phun put-khim huê-tî | Rushing forward, unable to turn back

21
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:37,859
亂世不滅吾俠義 | Luān-sè put-bia̍t ngôo hia̍p-gī | In a chaotic world, my chivalry shall never perish

22
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:39,039
節不燬 | Tsiat put huí | Honor remains unbroken

23
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:41,859
蒼天唯正氣長存 | Tshong-thian uî tsìng-khì tiông-tsûn | Under the heavens, righteousness alone endures forever

24
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:45,579
決戰時刻 勝者為王 | Kiat-tsiàn sî-khik sìng-tsiá uî ông | The decisive moment; the victor reigns as king

